{
  "h1": [
    "One drop of soap,",
    "and floating pepper",
    "races to the edge",
    "of the bowl.",
    "Nothing touched it.",
    "So what pulls the pepper?"
  ],
  "h2": [
    "Not the soap.",
    "Clean water further out",
    "pulls harder",
    "than the soapy spot,",
    "and drags the surface outward.",
    "In one lab study,",
    "that surface reached",
    "up to 0.5m/s."
  ],
  "h3": [
    "Yet with soap",
    "fed in steadily,",
    "the rush stops",
    "at a ring.",
    "Why there?"
  ],
  "h4": [
    "Here is the engine.",
    "At twenty five degrees,",
    "clean water pulls harder",
    "than our soap",
    "from episode two,",
    "SDS at an inferred 25mM",
    "in water:",
    "a gap of 35.54",
    "millinewtons per metre, calculated.",
    "That gap,",
    "not the soap itself,",
    "does the pulling."
  ],
  "c1": [
    "Zoom from the bowl",
    "down to its surface.",
    "Every patch of that surface",
    "pulls on its neighbours.",
    "Over clean water",
    "the pull is strong;",
    "over the soapy spot",
    "it is weaker.",
    "In our sketch,",
    "that tug of war",
    "is drawn as arrows."
  ],
  "p1": [
    "Long orange arrows",
    "over clean water,",
    "short ones over the soap.",
    "Where long meets short,",
    "the surface is dragged",
    "toward the long arrows, outward,",
    "and the water just below",
    "is dragged along.",
    "A flow driven",
    "by a difference in pull",
    "like this is called",
    "a Marangoni flow."
  ]
